  "title": "Celery Herb Stuffing and Savory Chicken",
  "description": "Parsley, sage, rosemary, and thyme season a roast chicken stuffing; the chicken is sprinkled with savory and roasted to perfection.",
  "authors": [
    "Loretta's Recipe Journal"
  ],
